hamiltonian H over angele with phase 90 degrees.\nSimRotate[din, H ,angle, \
phase] rotates the spin system din given the hamiltonian H over angele with \
phase.\ndin and H are generated by SimHamiltonian. \nThe angle and phase are \
defined in degree. \nThe output is a new spinsystem dout.", "Documentation" -> 
